# Progression graph

Do not add a shipped `BuiltinRegistrations` process (except `distill` / `infuse` stubs) or a `BuiltinMachines` entry without a `ProgressionNode` in `ProgressionCatalog` (chapter, `WINE` / `BEER` / `SHARED` line, parents).

Do not hand-edit `AlcoholicAdvancementProvider` or FTB SNBT. Change the catalogue, add translations, rerun datagen. See `.cursor/skills/alcoholic-progression-graph/SKILL.md` and ADR-036.
